# Test-data generator tests

Wrap generated fixture tests with `makeTestDataGeneratorTest` from
`lib/testUtilities/testDataGenerator.ts`. Ordinary `yarn jest` skips these
tests.

Run against the development environment by default:

```sh
yarn devdb-testdata-jest path/to/__testData__/<Name>/index.test.ts
```

Use `yarn proddb-testdata-jest` only when production data is required. Existing
JSON files are not overwritten; use `UPDATE=1` to refresh all generated files
or `UPDATE_PATTERN=FileName` to refresh one matching file.
